| Index Name | Content Source | Metadata Filters | Write Path |
|---|---|---|---|
| `nate-memory-search` | `conversation_history` | `user_id`, `session_id`, `family_id`, `group_id`, `tier`, `company_id` | `bridge_server.py` → `_memorize_pg()` |
| `nate-vault-search` | `vault_items` | `user_id`, `item_id`, `family_id`, `group_id`, `tier` | `vault_operations.py` → `add_item()` |
| `nate-wisdom` | `wisdom_extractions` | `user_id`, `family_id`, `group_id`, `company_id`, `tier`, `insight_type` | `lived_wisdom.py` → `store_extraction()` |
| `nate-me2me` | `me2me_imprint_entries` | `user_id`, `entry_id`, `family_id`, `group_id`, `tier` | `imprint_accumulator.py` → `flush()` |
| `nate-sessions` | Session memory index files | `coach_id`, `client_id`, `family_id`, `group_id`, `company_id` | `session_memory_store.py` → `store_session()` |
| `nate-annotations` | `vault_item_annotations` | `user_id`, `vault_item_id`, `family_id`, `group_id` | `bridge_server.py` (photo analysis handlers) |

## Backend Service

`backend/app/services/vectorize_service.py` provides:

- `generate_embeddings(texts)` — Workers AI REST API for batch embedding
- `upsert_vectors(index, vectors)` — Vectorize REST API for upserting
- `query_vectors(index, vector, top_k, filter)` — Vectorize REST API query
- `index_conversation/vault_item/wisdom/me2me_entry/session/annotation()` — High-level embed+upsert per content type (with scope metadata)
- `semantic_search(query, index, user_id)` — Embed query (with BGE prefix) + query single index
- `semantic_search_family(query, family_id)` — Family-scoped search across wisdom, sessions, me2me
- `semantic_search_group(query, group_id)` — Community group-scoped search across all indexes
- `semantic_search_all(query, user_id)` — Concurrent query across all 6 indexes
- `vision_describe_image(image_bytes)` — Workers AI Vision LLM description
- `image_to_image_search(image_bytes, user_id)` — Describe-then-embed image search
- `verify_push_pipeline(user_id)` — End-to-end push integrity test (embed → upsert → query → delete)
- `verify_retrieval_quality(user_id)` — Per-index reachability + metadata validation
- `batch_embed_and_upsert(index, items)` — Bulk backfill helper
- `CLINICAL_PHOTO_PROMPT` — Structured clinical annotation prompt for photo analysis

## Trust Auditor

`backend/app/services/vectorize_pipeline_auditor.py` — 30th trust auditor, 12 checks, 3x daily at stagger 65s.

| Tab | Checks | What It Tests |
|---|---|---|
| Embedding Health | 2 | Workers AI reachability + 384-dim validation |
| Push Pipeline | 3 | End-to-end embed → upsert → query-back → cleanup |
| Retrieval Quality | 6 | Each Vectorize index reachability |
| Data Integrity | 1 | Metadata schema validation (user_id present) |

Registered in Trust Enforcer as `vectorize_pipeline_audit_sent` with baseline key `vectorize_pipeline_check_count` = 12.

## Edge Worker

`cloudflare/workers/nate-edge-cache.js` handles:

- `POST /api/edge/semantic-search` — Embed at edge via `env.AI` (with BGE prefix), query Vectorize via bindings
- `GET /api/edge/vectorize/health` — Edge-level pipeline health: Workers AI + all 6 index reachability
- All existing edge cache rules unchanged

Worker bindings in `wrangler.toml`: `AI`, `MEMORY_INDEX`, `VAULT_INDEX`, `WISDOM_INDEX`, `ME2ME_INDEX`, `SESSION_INDEX`, `ANNOTATION_INDEX`, `VAULT_BUCKET`

## Search Endpoints

| Endpoint | Type | Description |
|---|---|---|
| `GET /api/client/memory/search/{hw_id}?q=...` | Hybrid | FTS + Vectorize semantic (merged, deduplicated) |
| `GET /api/client/memory/semantic-search/{hw_id}?q=...&index=all` | Pure semantic | Vectorize-only across specified indexes |
| `POST /api/client/memory/image-search/{hw_id}` | Image semantic | Vision LLM describe → embed → search annotations |
| `GET /api/client/vectorize/health` | Health | Push + retrieval pipeline integrity |
| `POST /api/edge/semantic-search` | Edge semantic | Zero-origin, runs entirely at Cloudflare edge |
| `GET /api/edge/vectorize/health` | Edge health | Workers AI + index reachability from edge |

